//! Phase-4A app-workflow binding over normal Artifact V2 tasks.
//!
//! App packages declare actions and workflow context, but they do not own an
//! executor. This module resolves one immutable package/action snapshot,
//! intersects it with the selected agent and live grant, creates a normal V3
//! task, and stores only bounded sidecars under that task. Consequential
//! dispatch and terminal mutation both re-open these sidecars and current app
//! registry state, so a delegated/retried/resumed worker cannot broaden the
//! original authority.

